        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "COMING SOON\r\n\r\nAn impressive detached residence extending to approx. 196 sq.m. (2,100 sq.ft.) on a generous 2.25-acre site, ideally located just minutes from the M3 motorway with easy access to Dublin, the M3 Parkway rail station, and the villages of Dunshaughlin and Dunboyne. \r\n\r\nThis spacious home features a large attic with conversion potential (subject to planning), detached garage, mature gardens, and well-fenced grounds ideal for hobby farming or equestrian use.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating, a private well, septic tank, water filtration system, fibre broadband, and a private tarmac driveway. A superb opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in a peaceful yet highly accessible location with excellent potential to further enhance."
